The OP mentions spawn/sync, so I looked it up, here's a snippet from Cilk's wikipedia page [1]:
  01 cilk int fib (int n)
  02 {
  03     if (n < 2) return n;
  04     else
  05     {
  06        int x, y;
  07  
  08        x = spawn fib (n-1);
  09        y = spawn fib (n-2);
  10  
  11        sync;
  12  
  13        return (x+y);
  14     }
  15 }

[1] http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cilk
